{
  "_about": "Every moment the game answers with a sound and a buzz, and every colour a floating number or word takes, in one place (autoload/feedback.gd). `sound` is a name in sounds.json, `buzz` a vibration in ms (phones), `gain_db` makes the sound softer or louder. Code asks by name: Feedback.moment(\"place\").",
